	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5da5fa0-ceec-42f8-8146-3c5ac23580d9")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1137b625-e23e-4946-b6c6-7c40a6a14b91")
	)
	(text "The board: USB from the Pi (its 3V3 = +3V3_PH, the bridge's E+).\nThe tool: U955 (+5V_BUCK1) through U953 and F951 to +5V_TOOL,\nout on CAT6 #2. Its 2 A never on the board's GND rails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82a2e904-e685-4c69-8fb6-8865916a532e")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "59c0a9d4-11f5-4507-b05c-af52ed3f11f9")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed at the gauges: orange = E, blue = S.\nGreen: the tool's ID + the QRE's output, brown: the QRE's 3V3/GND.\nSign and grams on the bench; diag() noise with a tool going on and off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab99d751-98eb-47b0-a1d5-3642182e0b2d")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa51023b-8f9a-48f2-a5fc-8d4d6406c65d")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5b68d777-067e-4e8f-91bc-1758c91a46a9")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "821cb598-491e-4e6a-bf63-24fcf10a5219")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9:\nthe tool's 5 V, GP28: the QRE (tool seated, any tool with\na white label). Data pins inputs until the tool has 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c9e1093-aa65-4a77-9db4-3edb75372e2f")
	)
